From 2b6972b40c8302f543e53c052c6131bc8a8a9ec1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 01:24:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Later-gen evolutions for Lv. 75+ teams, Trainer Tower counter
 suggestions (R22)

- trainer_evolutions.py (third pass): Lv. 75+ trainer Pokemon take any
  remaining evolution, including later-generation ones (9 Pokemon:
  Rhyperior, Lickilicky, Ursaluna, Tangrowth, Mismagius).
- validate.py: flags Lv. 75+ Pokemon with an evolution left undone.
- Spoiler guide: the peak page's matchup and counter logic is shared, and
  each Trainer Tower challenge now lists the types that hit it, the ones
  to avoid, and suggested counters.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
